\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse\b 
\par Verse
\par \'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Thou art my life; if Thou but turn away,
\par My life's a thousand deaths: Thou art my way;
\par Without Thee, Lord, I travel not, but stray.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. My light Thou art; without Thy glorious sight
\par My eyes are darkened with perpetual night:
\par My God, Thou art my way, my life, my light.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thou art my way; I wander, if Thou fly:
\par Thou art my light; if hid, how blind am I!
\par Thou art my life; if Thou withdraw, I die.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Disclose Thy sunbeams; close Thy wings and stay;
\par See, see how I am blind, and dead, and stray,
\par O Thou that art my light, my life, my way!\f1 
\par \cf1\ul 
\par }

